-- Updated report-schema and generic-quicksave expectations to the current supported behavior.
-- Fixed dependency mutation fixtures to include the report's actual settings module, so all controls reach and detect their intended defects.
-- Fixed the separate Windows installation auditor's path/handle timestamp comparison. File-identity, per-API change-time and reparse/mutation rejection remain enforced.
-- Fixed the installation inventory pin to hash saved bytes, eliminating Windows newline-conversion mismatch.
-- Added current phone/completion/notification regressions, all 18 Lua files to syntax coverage, saved-byte inventory checks and a frozen-runtime contract.
-- Added one portable release test runner and clean installation, support, attribution and publication documents.
